cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this list, please cite it as below. The licence (CC BY 4.0) requires attribution."
title: "Proxmint Free Proxy List"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Open HTTP, HTTPS, SOCKS4 and SOCKS5 proxies, each re-tested every 30 minutes
  with a real request routed through it. Entries that stop answering are dropped.
  Files are plain text per protocol plus a JSON file with country, anonymity,
  latency and uptime. The proxies belong to other people; the compilation
  (selection, validation results and measured fields) is licensed CC BY 4.0.
authors:
  - name: "Proxmint"
    website: "https://proxmint.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/proxmint/free-proxy-list"
url: "https://proxmint.com/free-proxies"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - free proxy list
  - open proxies
  - socks5
  - http proxy
  - web scraping
  - dataset
